The flag PNGs in this directory are rasterised from Circle Flags
(https://github.com/HatScripts/circle-flags): taken from `flags/<iso-3166-1-alpha-2>.svg`,
rendered at 64×64 with resvg, then filed under the FIFA trigram the payloads name a
nationality by. They are simulator fixtures — the device fetches its flags from the
deployment and ships none of these.

